===Go to the Great Mine and meet up with Hook{{subst:void|<!--201050107-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Great Mine|update|As you expected, Hook wants you to help her find daddy's treasure. But could there be a clue in the mine?<br />Hook's confidence cheers you up. No wonder she is the boss of the Moles.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
