:'''Hook:''' Too slow, (Trailblazer), Honorary Member of The Moles! You should have gotten here before Hook!
:'''Hook:''' Let me introduce you to Swetta. She is daddy's most trusted miner.
:'''Swetta:''' Not at all, Mr. Fersman trusts every vagrant, and every one of us trusts Mr. Fersman.
:'''Swetta:''' But after what happened over at that Geomarrow vein... the atmosphere at the shelter became a bit tense.
:'''Hook:''' I'm here to find daddy's treasure, his vein detector! I heard that someone stole it, is that true?
:'''Swetta:''' Well... I would guess that's probably true.
:'''Swetta:''' After the conflict in the mines, Wildfire gathered everyone at the shelter and took a headcount to check on the wounded. {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Four people were not there.}}
:'''Swetta:''' When we returned to the shelter, Mr. Fersman's detector was gone. We searched all around the shelter but found nothing... I guess {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|one of those four people was the thief}}.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No one else was at the shelter during that time.
::'''Swetta:''' Yes. The shelter was usually crowded, so thieves would've had a hard time stealing things when everyone was around.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} They picked the wrong time to commit the crime.
::'''Swetta:''' Indeed, now we can narrow down the scope of our search considerably.
:'''Swetta:''' We vagrants have our dignity, too. I'm sure we will catch the thief, but...
:'''Hook:''' But... what?
:'''Swetta:''' Actually, we've already asked those four suspects about it... but they all claimed to not have stolen anything.
:'''Swetta:''' Of course, we could never expect thieves to confess and turn themselves in, right? In my opinion, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|one of those four was lying}}.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The liar must be the thief.
::'''Swetta:''' I agree.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There can't be more than one?
::'''Swetta:''' Hmm, doesn't seem likely.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Arrest everyone and interrogate them one by one!
::'''Swetta:''' We're all vagrants. None of us have the authority to arrest anyone just because we feel like it.
::'''Swetta:''' Let's see whose words contradict with the facts, and that person would be the thief.
:'''Swetta:''' All four suspects are at the shelter. If you're feeling confident, why not go give it a try? Maybe you can determine who the thief is.
:'''Hook:''' Ugh, adults are so dishonest! Hook's gonna question them one by one!
