;(Talk to Balaway the Miner's Lamp)
----
:'''Balaway:''' I'm already retired from appraising ancient relics. So unless this detector is some kind of precious treasure...
:'''Hook:''' Look at this! The detector's probe broke off, can you fix it?
:'''Balaway:''' ...
:'''Balaway:''' Oh ho ho, this certainly is a rare relic! Let me take a closer look...
:'''Hook:''' Yes, look extra close! You have to help Hook fix it!
:'''Balaway:''' This device... I've been in the business for a long time, but never have I seen an ancient relic like this one before.
:'''Balaway:''' I think this is probably beyond repair. But still, it is a rare treasure. Even broken, I'd be willing to pay a high price for it. What do you say?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can we trust your appraisal?
::'''Balaway:''' The detector's probe is gone, it's like searching for something without eyes or ears. Now it's nothing more than a pile of junk with no practical value.
::'''Balaway:''' I'm willing to offer a generous price for this thing. So, do you want to sell it or not?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can you tell me more about it? I intend to sell it.
::'''Balaway:''' The detector's probe is gone, it's like searching for something without eyes or ears. Who's going to want a pile of junk?
::'''Balaway:''' I don't believe any other stores will buy it off you. Come on, I'll give you a nice deal.
:'''Hook:''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Boss, I think we should go.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe we should let Fersman decide what to do with it.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We aren't going to sell it to you, you crooked profiteer!
:'''Hook:''' ...
:'''Hook:''' Alright then, let's go find daddy...
----

